This repository is the public companion to the YouTube channel
"Finish Your Game Lab" (https://www.youtube.com/@FinishYourGameLab).

The source code, design notes, and prototypes contained in this
repository are published for educational viewing only. They are part
of an ongoing series of game-development videos and exist so that
viewers can follow along, study the implementation, and learn from the
process.

Permitted (without prior written permission):
